{"answer": "**Budget Numbers Thread \u2013 Participants & Commitments**\n\n| Participant | Email id (resource) | Commitment(s) |\n|-------------|---------------------|---------------|\n| **Alice Ander** | `ct-alice` | *\u201cOffsite is already committed; look at contractors.\u201d*  <br>\u202f\u2022 Focus on contractor spend.<br>*\u201cPlease put proposals in the thread by Thursday.\u201d*  <br>\u202f\u2022 Expect proposals from all members by Thursday. |\n| **Bobby (ct\u2011bob)** | `ct-bob` | *\u201cThe travel line looks high to me.\u201d*  <br>\u202f\u2022 Review travel expenses.<br>*\u201cContractor spend is mostly the migration project.\u201d*  <br>\u202f\u2022 Acknowledges contractor spend.<br>*\u201cRight, two renewals we can downgrade.\u201d*  <br>\u202f\u2022 Commit to downgrade two Q4 tooling renewals.<br>*\u201cI will take travel scenarios.\u201d*  <br>\u202f\u2022 Will detail travel scenarios. |\n| **Carol Corte** | `ct-carol` | *\u201cAlso the tooling renewals land in Q4.\u201d*  <br>\u202f\u2022 Note on Q4 tooling renewals.<br>*\u201cWill do. I will take tooling.\u201d*  <br>\u202f\u2022 Will handle the tooling", "answer_hash": "79fad2aae1a873337e36a14ee942ec618dda6cf1c794d3f23cec169138f98fad", "kind": "task_end", "receipt_id": "r-17", "seq": 17, "task_id": "t2-group-thread-resolution", "truncated": false, "ts": 1020.0}
